---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import SwrFittingRateTable from '../../../components/SwrFittingRateTable.astro';
import { swrRingFitCouplers } from '../../../data/swrRingFitCouplers';

const catalogueUrl = '/catalogue/flowin-price-list-2026.pdf#page=11';
---

<BaseLayout title="SWR ring-fit couplers | Flowin Pipes & Fittings" description="Flowin SWR ring-fit coupler sizes, box packing and rates from the 2026 catalogue.">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main>
    <div class="wrap product-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/products/swr/">SWR drainage</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Ring-fit couplers</span></div>
    <section class="wrap product-hero" aria-labelledby="family-title"><div class="product-hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">SWR drainage / ring fit</span><h1 id="family-title">Ring-fit<br />couplers.</h1><p class="product-lead">Compare Flowin ring-fit coupler sizes in 75 mm and 110 mm, including catalogue box packing and per-piece rates.</p><p class="product-standard">Catalogue section: <strong>SWR FITTING (RING FIT)</strong>. These tables cover only the ring-fit coupler shown here.</p><div class="product-actions"><a class="solid-btn" href="#sizes">View sizes &amp; rates <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="text-link" href={catalogueUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">See catalogue page 11 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
      <figure class="product-visual swr-coupler-visual"><svg viewBox="0 0 500 500" role="img" aria-label="Simple line illustration of two ring-fit drainage couplers"><defs><linearGradient id="coupler-body" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#fff" /><stop offset="1" stop-color="#c7c9c5" /></linearGradient></defs><path d="M145 80h210v340H145z" fill="url(#coupler-body)" stroke="#91958f" stroke-width="3"/><ellipse cx="250" cy="80" rx="105" ry="30" fill="#d8dbd6" stroke="#91958f" stroke-width="3"/><ellipse cx="250" cy="80" rx="79" ry="19" fill="#636963"/><ellipse cx="250" cy="420" rx="105" ry="30" fill="#d8dbd6" stroke="#91958f" stroke-width="3"/><ellipse cx="250" cy="420" rx="79" ry="19" fill="#636963"/><path d="M153 87c28 20 140 20 194 0M153 413c28-20 140-20 194 0M145 190h210M145 310h210" fill="none" stroke="#c64d18" stroke-width="5"/></svg><figcaption>Illustrative coupler diagram; not a product photograph.</figcaption></figure>
    </section>
    <section class="product-data" id="sizes" aria-labelledby="sizes-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="product-data-intro"><span class="eyebrow">Catalogue details</span><h2 id="sizes-title">Sizes, box packing<br />and rates.</h2><p>The ring-fit coupler table from page 11 is shown as printed. The PDF’s “=” decimal marks are displayed as points; no currency is inferred.</p></div><div class="variant-grid">{swrRingFitCouplers.map((variant, index) => <SwrFittingRateTable variant={variant} number={String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')} />)}</div><div class="source-band"><p>Source: Flowin Price list 2026, PDF page 11. Rates are per piece and packing is per box. The original catalogue is definitive.</p><a href={catalogueUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open original table ↗</a></div></div></section>
    <section class="wrap family-outro" aria-labelledby="family-outro-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">More ring-fit products</span><h2 id="family-outro-title">Need pipes or<br />other fittings?</h2></div><div><p>Ring-fit pipes, 87.5-degree bends and tees have their own verified tables. Reducers and accessories remain available in the original catalogue while their web tables are reviewed.</p><a class="solid-btn" href="/products/swr/ring-fit-pipes/">View ring-fit pipes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  </main><SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
